title: "Theoryscope: renormalisation group theory and eigenvector analysis for intellectual history"
abstract: >-
  Renormalisation group theory and eigenvector analysis brought to intellectual history
  and critical theory as a critical method, applied to a corpus of theoretical texts.
  Part of the Vector Lab family of research instruments.
